<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>eFootball Master - Racikan Formasi & Pemain</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,600;0,800;1,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #060919;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        div.navbar {
            background: rgba(10, 15, 38, 0.95);
            padding: 15px 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #0066ff;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        div.logo {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        div.logo span {
            color: #e6ff00;
        }

        div.nav-links a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        div.nav-links a:hover {
            color: #e6ff00;
        }

        /* Hero Banner */
        div.hero {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,102,255,0.2) 0%, rgba(6,9,25,1) 100%);
        }

        div.hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        div.hero p {
            color: #aaaaaa;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        /* Container & Grid Layout */
        div.container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        div.section-title {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-left: 5px solid #e6ff00;
            padding-left: 15px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        div.grid-cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        /* Cards Style */
        div.card {
            background: #0f1633;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 102, 255, 0.3);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        div.card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: #e6ff00;
        }

        div.card-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #0066ff;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        div.card-title {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        div.card-desc {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #cccccc;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        /* Detail Stats List */
        div.stats-list {
            background: #080d21;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        div.stats-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 6px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        div.stats-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        div.stats-label {
            color: #aaa;
        }

        div.stats-val {
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #e6ff00;
        }

        /* Pitch Simulation (Visual Lapangan) */
        div.pitch-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1b5e20, #2e7d32);
            height: 180px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            border: 2px solid #ffffff33;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        /* Footer */
        div.footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            background: #03050d;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            color: #777;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            div.navbar {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 10px;
            }
            div.nav-links a {
                margin: 0 10px;
            }
            div.hero h1 {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <div class="navbar">
        <div class="logo"><span>e</span>FOOTBALL MASTER</div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#formasi">Racikan Formasi</a>
            <a href="#pemain">Racikan Pemain</a>
            <a href="#gaya-main">Gaya Main</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>DATABASE RACIKAN & TAKTIK META</h1>
        <p>Panduan racikan poin pemain maksimal dan formasi terbaik untuk Push Rank Division 1</p>
    </div>

    <div class="container">

        <!-- SECTION 1: RACIKAN FORMASI META -->
        <div id="formasi">
            <div class="section-title">Formasi META Terbaik</div>
            <div class="grid-cards">

                <!-- Formasi 1 -->
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-badge">META DIVISION 1</div>
                    <div class="pitch-box">4 - 1 - 2 - 3</div>
                    <div class="card-title">4-1-2-3 Defensif Kontra</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">Sangat cocok untuk serangan balik cepat dengan eksploitasi lebar lapangan lewat winger kencang.</div>
                    <div class="stats-list">
                        <div class="stats-item">
                            <div class="stats-label">Gaya Main Ideal:</div>
                            <div class="stats-val">Serangan Balik Cepat</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stats-item">
                            <div class="stats-label">Posisi Kunci:</div>
                            <div class="stats-val">2 AMF + 1 DMF Anchor</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stats-item">
                            <div class="stats-label">Kelebihan:</div>
                            <div class="stats-val">Serangan Sayap Mematikan</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Formasi 2 -->
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-badge">STABIL DEFENSE</div>
                    <div class="pitch-box">4 - 2 - 2 - 2</div>
                    <div class="card-title">4-2-2-2 (2 AMF)</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">Formasi paling seimbang untuk menguasai lini tengah dan membongkar pertahanan rapat lawan.</div>
                    <div class="stats-list">
                        <div class="stats-item">
                            <div class="stats-label">Gaya Main Ideal:</div>
                            <div class="stats-val">Penguasaan Bola / Pengumpan</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stats-item">
                            <div class="stats-label">Posisi Kunci:</div>
                            <div class="stats-val">2 CMF + 2 AMF Kreatif</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stats-item">
                            <div class="stats-label">Kelebihan:</div>
                            <div class="stats-val">Lini Tengah Rapat</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Formasi 3 -->
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-badge">FULL ATTACK</div>
                    <div class="pitch-box">3 - 2 - 3 - 2</div>
                    <div class="card-title">3-2-3-2 Serangan Tengah</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">Formasi agresif untuk mendominasi area penalti lawan. Membutuhkan bek tengah dengan speed tinggi.</div>
                    <div class="stats-list">
                        <div class="stats-item">
                            <div class="stats-label">Gaya Main Ideal:</div>
                            <div class="stats-val">Serangan Balik (Long Ball)</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stats-item">
                            <div class="stats-label">Posisi Kunci:</div>
                            <div class="stats-val">LMF/RMF Speed Tinggi</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="stats-item">
                            <div class="stats-label">Kelebihan:</div>
                            <div class="stats-val">Unggul Jumlah Pemain Depan</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 2: RACIKAN POIN PEMAIN -->
        <div id="pemain">
            <div class="section-title">Racikan Poin Latihan Pemain</div>
            <div class="grid-cards">

                <!-- Pemain 1 -->
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-badge">EPIC / BIG TIME</div>
                    <div class="card-title">Kylian Mbappé (CF)</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">Fokus racikan pada Speed 95+ dan Finishing tinggi agar tajam di dalam kotak penalti.</div>
                    <div class="stats-list">
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Tembakan (Shooting):</div><div class="stats-val">8</div></div>
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Umpan (Passing):</div><div class="stats-val">1</div></div>
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Dribel (Dribbling):</div><div class="stats-val">8</div></div>
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Dexterity (Kesadaran Offense):</div><div class="stats-val">10</div></div>
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Kekuatan Tubuh Bawah (Speed):</div><div class="stats-val">12</div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pemain 2 -->
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-badge">HIGHLIGHT</div>
                    <div class="card-title">Jude Bellingham (AMF)</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">Racikan Box-to-Box seimbang antara stamina, dribel halus, dan umpan terobosan.</div>
                    <div class="stats-list">
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Tembakan (Shooting):</div><div class="stats-val">5</div></div>
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Umpan (Passing):</div><div class="stats-val">6</div></div>
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Dribel (Dribbling):</div><div class="stats-val">8</div></div>
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Dexterity:</div><div class="stats-val">7</div></div>
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Kekuatan Tubuh Bawah:</div><div class="stats-val">8</div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Pemain 3 -->
                <div class="card">
                    <div class="card-badge">SHOWTIME</div>
                    <div class="card-title">Virgil van Dijk (CB)</div>
                    <div class="card-desc">Racikan khusus pertahanan udara kokoh, fisik tinggi, dan kesadaran bertahan 96+.</div>
                    <div class="stats-list">
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Dexterity (Akselerasi):</div><div class="stats-val">2</div></div>
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Kekuatan Tubuh Bawah:</div><div class="stats-val">6</div></div>
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Kekuatan Udara (Aerobic):</div><div class="stats-val">8</div></div>
                        <div class="stats-item"><div class="stats-label">Defending (Bertahan):</div><div class="stats-val">14</div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="footer">
        <p>© 2026 eFootball Master. Semua hak cipta dilindungi. Tidak terafiliasi langsung dengan Konami.</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
